1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:01,800
(Leonard:)Oh, you heard?

2
00:00:01,800 --> 00:00:05,700
"Scotty, I need more power."

3
00:00:05,700 --> 00:00:09,000
(Leonard:)Sorry. Does Sheldon know
you're sleeping in here?

4
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:11,240
(Raj:)Are you kidding?
He made me sign a waiver,

5
00:00:11,240 --> 00:00:13,410
(Raj:)participate in
an emergency fire drill

6
00:00:13,410 --> 00:00:16,840
(Raj:)and take a refresher course
in CPR.

7
00:00:16,840 --> 00:00:18,880
(Raj:)Thank God he had a dummy.

8
00:00:18,880 --> 00:00:21,920
(Leonard:)Oh, yeah.
Mouth-to-Mouth Mona.

9
00:00:21,920 --> 00:00:24,550
(Penny:)You know,
she used to date Howard?

10
00:00:24,550 --> 00:00:27,890
Oh, my God, she's that Mona?

11
00:00:27,890 --> 00:00:31,420
(Raj:)Why can't you and my sister
spend your nights here?

12
00:00:31,430 --> 00:00:33,530
(Leonard:)We tried. She doesn't get along
with Sheldon.

13
00:00:33,530 --> 00:00:35,960
(Raj:)Sheldon doesn't get along
with Sheldon.

14
00:00:35,960 --> 00:00:38,700
(Raj:)It's still no reason
for me to have to listen to you

15
00:00:38,700 --> 00:00:41,500
(Raj:)arm your
photon torpedoes every night.

16
00:00:41,500 --> 00:00:44,800
Okay, well, how about this:
until Priya gets her own place,

17
00:00:44,800 --> 00:00:47,070
(Leonard:)you stay here and I'll stay at
your apartment.

18
00:00:47,070 --> 00:00:51,010
(Raj:)Can I bring girls here?

19
00:00:51,010 --> 00:00:53,510
(Leonard:)You?

20
00:00:53,510 --> 00:00:55,580
(Leonard:)Sure. Bring as many as you want.

21
00:00:55,580 --> 00:01:00,020
(Raj:)Okay, deal.

